units real
atom_style full
boundary p p p

pair_style lj/class2 9.0
pair_modify mix sixthpower
bond_style class2
angle_style class2
dihedral_style none
improper_style class2
special_bonds lj/coul 0.0 0.0 1.0 angle no dihedral no
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check no

read_data system.data

pair_coeff 1 1 0.0 3.50
bond_coeff 1 1.45 210.0 -28.0 6.0
angle_coeff 1 109.0 28.0 -3.0 0.8
angle_coeff 1 bb 4.5 1.45 1.45
angle_coeff 1 ba 1.3 1.1 1.45 1.45
improper_coeff 1 25.0 0.0
improper_coeff 1 aa 1.20 1.00 0.90 110.0 109.0 108.0

dump 1 all custom 1 forces.lammps id fx fy fz
dump_modify 1 sort id
run 0
